  "description": "Provides powerful text generation capabilities for TuanZi applications using Razor templating, including:\n\t\t\t- Razor syntax support for dynamic templates\n\t\t\t- Model-based template rendering\n\t\t\t- Layout and partial template support\n\t\t\t- Template compilation and caching\n\t\t\t- Custom template discovery\n\t\t\t- Localization support\n\t\t\t- Multiple output format generation\n\t\t\t- Lightweight runtime template processing\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi dependency injection",
